    "summary": "Use it in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) on an **ADEPTA SORORITAS** unit of yours that disembarked this turn from a **TRANSPORT** and is not yet picked to shoot this phase. For the rest of the phase, its models get +1 on **[Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** for ranged attacks at an enemy unit that is:\n\n- within 6\" of the attacking model\n- in range of an [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)\n\nIf those attacks destroy any enemy models, pick 1 of the **destroyed** models: its unit takes a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).",
